  "个人主页": "Creator profile",
  "汇集作品、方案与 AI 创作，连接创作者。": "Bring together projects, plans, and AI creations to connect with other makers.",
  "Palmake 个人主页原型：作品与方案分类、AI 创作入口及个人资料": "Palmake creator profile prototype: project categories, AI creation, and profile information",
  "用户研究 / C 端体验": "User research / Consumer UX",
  "围绕车手，重新连接 F1 粉丝体验": "Reconnecting the F1 fan experience around drivers",
  "担任组长，带队访谈来自 4 个国家的 12 位用户，将车手资讯和粉丝交流做成互动原型。": "As team lead, I guided interviews with 12 people from four countries and developed an interactive prototype for driver news and fan connections.",
  "研究与交互原型": "Research & interactive prototype",
  "Sky Sports F1 / 粉丝互动体验": "Sky Sports F1 / Fan engagement",
  "项目组长 · 主导用户研究与交互方案": "Team lead · User research and interaction design",
  "粉丝关注的不只是比赛结果，还有车手是谁、他们如何生活，以及如何与其他粉丝分享热爱。在 Sky Sports 项目中，我带领小组探索现有移动端产品如何承载这些不同的需求。": "Fans follow more than race results. They care about who drivers are, their lives, and sharing that passion with others. I led a team exploring how the existing Sky Sports mobile app could support these needs.",
  "车手资讯散落在多个平台；不同粉丝对技术数据、幕后故事和互动表达有不同偏好。一个统一的信息流，很难同时回应所有人的关注点。": "Driver news is scattered across platforms, while fans differ in their appetite for technical data, behind-the-scenes stories, and ways to participate. A single feed struggles to serve all of them.",
  "我担任组长，组织了覆盖 4 个国家、12 位用户的深度访谈，提炼出两类用户画像，并带队设计个性化仪表盘和粉丝社区的交互原型。项目原稿记录了访谈、亲和图、体验地图、故事版和界面迭代，展示从研究发现到设计取舍的过程。": "I led interviews with 12 users across four countries, synthesized two personas, and guided prototypes for a personalized dashboard and fan community. The original work documents interviews, affinity mapping, experience maps, storyboards, and interface iterations.",
  "扩展已有产品，保持连续性": "Extend the existing product",
  "在 Sky Sports 原有应用的操作逻辑与品牌基础上扩展功能，保留用户熟悉的入口和使用方式。": "Build on the Sky Sports app's familiar interaction patterns and brand, preserving recognizable entry points and behavior.",
  "让关注对象组织信息": "Organize information around who fans follow",
  "通过可定制仪表盘聚合关注车手、赛程和资讯，并用赛前、赛中、赛后的触点检查内容与时机。": "A customizable dashboard brings together drivers, schedules, and news. Pre-race, live-race, and post-race touchpoints helped us consider both content and timing.",
  "让内容与表达相连": "Connect content with participation",
  "将车手主页与社区讨论、投票、粉丝墙和活动关联；根据原型反馈补充赛事结果，并调整含义不明确的按钮。": "Link driver profiles to discussions, polls, fan walls, and events. Prototype feedback led us to add race results and clarify ambiguous controls.",
  "形成用户画像、体验地图、故事版、信息架构及中高保真原型，并记录反馈后的界面调整。": "Produced personas, experience maps, storyboards, information architecture, and medium- to high-fidelity prototypes, with documented revisions based on feedback.",
  "展示阶段为用户研究与交互设计，不将参与度、情感联结等设计目标当作上线效果。": "This work demonstrates research and interaction design. Engagement and emotional connection were design goals, not measured outcomes from a launched product.",
  "有价值的个性化，需要先理解用户在什么时刻关注什么，再决定信息如何聚合，以及哪些互动值得被放到前面。": "Useful personalization begins with understanding what people care about and when. That should guide how information is combined and which interactions deserve attention.",
  "项目概览": "Project overview",
  "项目概览 · 历史作品原稿": "Project overview · Original design work",
