  "原型反馈与迭代 · 历史作品原稿": "Prototype feedback and iteration · Original design work",
  "高保真交互页面": "High-fidelity interaction screens",
  "高保真交互页面 · 历史作品原稿": "High-fidelity interaction screens · Original design work",
  "硬件数据 / 行为设计": "Hardware data / Behavioral design",
  "把能耗数据，转化为每天愿意做的小行动": "Turning energy data into small daily actions",
  "围绕智能电表数据，探索小目标、即时反馈与家庭节能挑战。": "Exploring small goals, immediate feedback, and household energy-saving challenges using smart meter data.",
  "概念产品与原型": "Product concept & prototype",
  "EcoChamps / 节能生活应用": "EcoChamps / Energy-saving app",
  "用户体验、服务流程与游戏化方案探索": "UX, service flows, and gamification exploration",
  "看到用电量，不等于知道下一步怎么做。EcoChamps 是一个基于智能电表数据的概念应用，尝试把抽象数字转化为可理解的目标、反馈和日常行动。": "Seeing energy use doesn't mean knowing what to do next. EcoChamps is a concept app based on smart meter data, exploring how abstract numbers can become understandable goals, feedback, and everyday actions.",
  "用户不容易把能耗信息转化为具体行为，也容易在缺少反馈和动力时放弃长期目标。方案需要在有限的注意力里，连接理解、行动与持续参与。": "People struggle to turn energy information into concrete behavior and can lose motivation without feedback. The design needed to connect understanding, action, and sustained participation within limited attention.",
  "项目工作涵盖用户洞察、用户画像、服务与功能流程、游戏化机制、视觉规范和交互原型，重点探索数据如何进入家庭用户的日常任务。": "My work covered user insights, personas, service and feature flows, gamification, visual guidelines, and prototypes, focusing on how data could fit everyday household tasks.",
  "把数据和行动放在一起": "Put data beside actions",
  "以个性化仪表盘组织能耗、提醒和挑战进度，让用户在看见信息时，也能理解可采取的下一步。": "A personalized dashboard combines energy use, reminders, and challenge progress so that people see both information and a useful next step.",
  "让长期目标变成小挑战": "Turn long-term goals into small challenges",
  "把目标拆成每日与每周任务，用进度、积分和奖励方案表达反馈，探索家庭成员共同参与的动力。": "Break goals into daily and weekly tasks, using progress, points, and reward concepts to explore what motivates household participation.",
  "优先核心任务，收拢范围": "Prioritize the core tasks",
  "原型迭代中后置非核心个人简介模块，优先优化挑战反馈、排名互动和好友进度入口。": "During iteration, we deferred a nonessential profile module and prioritized challenge feedback, leaderboard interactions, and access to friends' progress.",
  "形成用户洞察、功能架构、故事版、设计系统和高保真页面，并记录原型迭代方向。": "Produced insights, feature architecture, storyboards, a design system, and high-fidelity screens, with documented directions for iteration.",
  "概念应用与原型设计；电表实时接入、奖励兑换及节能效果不作为已实现能力。原稿中的任务数值为情境示意。": "This is a concept and prototype. Live meter integration, reward redemption, and energy savings were not implemented or validated. Task values in the original designs are illustrative.",
  "硬件产生的数据，只有进入用户能够理解和执行的任务，才可能变得有价值。激励机制也应服务核心行为。": "Hardware data becomes useful when it supports tasks people understand and can act on. Incentives should reinforce those core behaviors.",
  "背景与智能电表场景": "Context and smart meter scenarios",
  "背景与智能电表场景 · 历史作品原稿": "Context and smart meter scenarios · Original design work",
