  "B 端工作流 / AI 探索": "Business workflows / AI exploration",
  "先理清诊所日常工作，再找到 AI 的位置": "Understand clinic workflows before finding a role for AI",
  "Curadent 诊所 CRM": "Curadent Clinic CRM",
  "聚合预约、人员与运营信息，探索对话式操作如何进入业务工作流。": "Bringing appointments, staff, and operational information together while exploring conversational workflows.",
  "产品设计与概念探索": "Product design & concept exploration",
  "Curadent / 私人诊所工作台": "Curadent / Private clinic workspace",
  "业务场景、CRM 界面与扩展方案设计": "Business scenarios, CRM interfaces, and extension concepts",
  "小型诊所需要快速了解当日预约、人员可用时间和运营信息。Curadent 以虚拟诊所为场景，探索一个轻量工作台，以及对话式操作和 AI 能力可能出现的位置。": "Small clinics need a quick view of appointments, staff availability, and operations. Curadent uses a fictional clinic to explore a lightweight workspace and potential roles for conversation and AI.",
  "业务信息分散会增加查看和协调成本；新增能力若脱离现有任务，也可能制造更多操作负担。需要先建立清晰的信息结构与工作流。": "Scattered information makes coordination harder. New capabilities can add more work if they don't fit existing tasks, so clear information architecture and workflows come first.",
  "围绕私人诊所场景进行 CRM 界面与扩展方案探索，原稿包括虚拟品牌、设计规范、仪表盘、预约流程和对话交互。": "I explored CRM interfaces and extensions for a private clinic. The original work includes a fictional brand, design guidelines, dashboard, appointment flows, and conversational interactions.",
  "围绕日常工作聚合信息": "Organize information around everyday work",
  "将预约、患者与团队可用时间组织在首页，服务开诊前查看和周期性运营回顾。": "Combine appointments, patient information, and team availability on the home screen to support opening checks and regular operational reviews.",
  "让状态和动作一起出现": "Present states together with actions",
  "日历展示预约状态，支持时段选择和逐步输入；以明确的确认结果收束操作，另探索对话式查询、录入与提醒。": "The calendar shows appointment states and supports time-slot selection and guided entry, ending with clear confirmation. I also explored conversational search, entry, and reminders.",
  "把 AI 放进具体任务": "Give AI a specific task",
  "将 AI 与 VR 作为后续扩展，探索患者档案、影像查看和随访中的接入点，先说明服务什么任务。": "Treat AI and VR as possible extensions for patient records, imaging review, and follow-up, first defining the task each would support.",
  "形成品牌与设计系统、工作台、预约和对话流程，以及 AI／VR 扩展方案。": "Produced a brand and design system, workspace, appointment and conversation flows, and AI/VR extension concepts.",
  "Curadent 是虚拟诊所设计项目。AI／VR 为概念扩展，未据此声称模型训练、医疗效果或临床部署。": "Curadent is a fictional clinic design project. AI and VR are conceptual extensions, not evidence of model training, clinical deployment, or medical outcomes.",
  "AI 产品的起点是一个值得改善的工作流。先把对象、状态和决策理清，再讨论智能能力应该如何介入。": "An AI product starts with a workflow worth improving. Clarify the objects, states, and decisions before deciding where intelligent capabilities belong.",
