  "AI 与 VR 扩展探索 · 历史作品原稿": "AI and VR extensions · Original design work",
  "空间交互 / 体验设计": "Spatial interaction / Experience design",
  "让沉浸式体验，回应人的感受与理解方式": "Immersive experiences shaped around how people feel and learn",
  "VR 沉浸式体验": "Immersive VR experiences",
  "两个设计探索：轻量冥想交互，以及面向儿童的消防情境学习。": "Two explorations: gentle meditation interactions and scenario-based fire safety learning for children.",
  "沉浸式交互原型": "Immersive interaction prototypes",
  "VR / 冥想空间与儿童情境教育": "VR / Meditation and children's learning",
  "场景、引导、反馈与沉浸式交互探索": "Scenes, guidance, feedback, and immersive interaction",
  "同样是 VR，平静的冥想空间和儿童学习情境，需要不同的节奏与反馈。这两个项目探索声音、空间、动作和视觉提示如何共同影响体验。": "A calm meditation space and a learning scenario for children need different rhythms and feedback. These projects explore how sound, space, movement, and visual cues shape an experience together.",
  "冥想场景需要降低主动投入的负担；儿童学习场景则需要让复杂指令变得直观。沉浸感之外，认知负担、视点和反馈强度同样需要设计。": "Meditation should require little effort to enter, while children's learning needs intuitive instructions. Beyond immersion, cognitive load, viewpoint, and feedback intensity all need design attention.",
  "在冥想项目中参与轻量互动设计，以投掷、光点、呼吸和摇动树枝等动作构建环境回应；消防项目原稿呈现了场景、旅程、指令、声音和表情反馈的设计探索。": "In the meditation project, I contributed lightweight interactions using throwing, light, breathing, and moving branches. The fire safety work explores scenarios, journeys, instructions, audio, and facial feedback.",
  "用低负担互动进入冥想": "Enter meditation through gentle interaction",
  "通过渐进引导和象征性动作，让行为获得柔和的环境回应，避免把冥想变成一连串高强度任务。": "Use gradual guidance and symbolic actions with subtle environmental responses, avoiding a sequence of demanding tasks.",
  "把情境学习拆成连续选择": "Build learning through connected choices",
  "将故事、场景判断、即时反馈与复盘串联，以图形、简短提示和语音减少对长文本的依赖。": "Connect story, situational decisions, immediate feedback, and reflection. Graphics, short prompts, and voice reduce dependence on long text.",
  "把身体与认知约束纳入设计": "Consider physical and cognitive constraints",
  "考虑儿童视点高度、声音强度和佩戴体验，探索真实感与紧张程度之间的平衡。": "Account for children's eye level, sound intensity, and headset experience while balancing realism and tension.",
  "形成用户流程、概念草图、故事版、旅程图、VR 场景和交互细节展示。两组原稿均保留在下方。": "Produced user flows, concept sketches, storyboards, journey maps, VR scenes, and interaction details. Both sets of original work are shown below.",
  "展示为历史设计方案与原型。原稿中的情绪及学习效果表述，不作为已验证的疗效或教育成果。": "These are earlier design proposals and prototypes. Statements about emotion or learning in the original work are not validated therapeutic or educational outcomes.",
  "空间体验的品质不只取决于画面。如何进入、何时回应、反馈有多强，都会改变用户的感受和理解。": "Spatial experience is about more than imagery. How people enter, when the environment responds, and how strongly it responds shape both feeling and understanding.",
  "VR 项目概览": "VR project overview",
  "VR 项目概览 · 历史作品原稿": "VR project overview · Original design work",
