  "服务设计 / 代际交流": "Service design / Intergenerational connection",
  "把养老服务，也放进家人的日常": "Making eldercare part of family life",
  "将社区养老服务、家人参与与代际交流放在同一套服务体验中考虑。": "Considering community eldercare, family involvement, and intergenerational connection as one service experience.",
  "服务与交互设计": "Service & interaction design",
  "Silver Bond / 养老社区服务": "Silver Bond / Community eldercare",
  "养老场景与服务体验探索": "Eldercare scenarios and service experience exploration",
  "养老服务关乎事务，也关乎关系。Silver Bond 从养老与代际情感出发，探索社区服务如何连接长者的日常需要，以及家人的参与。": "Eldercare is about relationships as well as practical needs. Silver Bond explores how community services can connect older adults' everyday needs with family participation.",
  "服务供给与情感连接往往分开被讨论。方案需要同时考虑不同角色的需要，以及他们在服务过程中的接触点。": "Service provision and emotional connection are often discussed separately. The design needed to consider different people's needs and their touchpoints throughout the service.",
  "这组设计作品将养老情境、用户需求、服务过程与移动端页面放在一起，通过研究与流程表达探索跨角色的服务体验。": "This work combines eldercare scenarios, user needs, service processes, and mobile screens, using research and journey mapping to explore an experience across multiple roles.",
  "把长者与家人放进同一服务视角": "Consider older adults and families together",
  "关注长者需求，也将后代参与和代际交流纳入服务目标，避免只以服务管理者的任务组织体验。": "Include family participation and intergenerational connection alongside older adults' needs, rather than organizing everything around service administrators.",
  "先梳理触点，再设计页面": "Map touchpoints before designing screens",
  "利用用户旅程组织服务阶段与机会点，再将主要任务转化为移动端界面。": "Use journeys to organize service stages and opportunities, then translate the main tasks into mobile interfaces.",
  "让关系与服务相互支持": "Connect relationships with everyday services",
  "在社区养老情境中探索日常服务与情感互动的连接，让产品问题同时包含效率与人的感受。": "Explore how practical community eldercare and emotional interaction can support each other, considering both efficiency and people's feelings.",
  "形成背景研究、服务与用户旅程，以及移动端界面设计原稿。": "Produced background research, service and user journeys, and original mobile interface designs.",
  "服务设计与交互探索，未声称已运营服务或实际改善养老效果。": "This is service and interaction design exploration, not an operating service or evidence of improved care outcomes.",
  "跨角色产品需要理解不同人的任务，也需要看见任务背后的关系。流程设计与情感体验可以在同一个服务中被考虑。": "Products serving several roles need to understand both individual tasks and the relationships behind them. Process and emotional experience can be designed together.",
  "养老社区场景与研究": "Community eldercare scenarios and research",
  "养老社区场景与研究 · 历史作品原稿": "Community eldercare scenarios and research · Original design work",
  "服务旅程与界面设计": "Service journey and interface design",
  "服务旅程与界面设计 · 历史作品原稿": "Service journey and interface design · Original design work",
  "可穿戴 / 互动装置": "Wearables / Interactive installations",
  "在身体、情感与技术之间，继续探索": "Exploring the space between body, emotion, and technology",
  "可穿戴与互动装置": "Wearables & interactive installations",
  "通过推测性可穿戴系统和情感互动装置，拓展对实体产品体验的理解。": "Expanding my understanding of physical product experiences through speculative wearables and emotional interaction.",
  "跨领域设计探索": "Cross-disciplinary design exploration",
  "Other Works / 实体与情感交互": "Other work / Physical and emotional interaction",
  "产品概念与交互表达探索": "Product concepts and interaction exploration",
  "2025 作品整理": "Work compiled in 2025",
  "工业设计训练让我习惯从身体、环境和材料出发思考产品。这些探索把未来情境、可穿戴系统和情感表达带入交互设计。": "Industrial design taught me to start with the body, environment, and materials. These explorations bring future scenarios, wearable systems, and emotional expression into interaction design.",
  "并非所有体验都发生在屏幕中。实体设备、身体动作和隐喻性的反馈，也会改变人如何理解信息与表达关系。": "Not every experience happens on a screen. Physical devices, bodily actions, and metaphorical feedback also shape how people understand information and express relationships.",
  "作品包括 I-Health 推测性可穿戴系统，以及利用 Arduino 传感器探索亲子情感表达的互动装置。以下保留原始概念、造型和场景展示。": "The work includes I-Health, a speculative wearable system, and an installation using Arduino sensors to explore parent–child emotional expression. The original concepts, forms, and scenarios are shown below.",
  "用未来情境提出设计问题": "Use future scenarios to ask design questions",
  "I-Health 以推测性设定探索身体与环境的关系，通过系统和形态设计表达概念。": "I-Health uses a speculative setting to explore relationships between the body and environment through system and form design.",
  "用动作表达不容易说出的话": "Express through actions what is hard to say",
  "互动装置围绕亲子关系中直接赞美的缺席，将情感主题转化为传感器输入与可感知反馈。": "The installation responds to the absence of direct praise in parent–child relationships, translating an emotional theme into sensor input and perceptible feedback.",
  "跨越界面，考虑完整体验": "Look beyond the interface",
  "将实体形态、操作方式、空间环境与反馈一起考虑，保持对屏幕之外体验的敏感。": "Consider physical form, operation, space, and feedback together, remaining attentive to experiences beyond the screen.",
  "形成可穿戴概念、形态与场景展示，以及互动装置构思和操作流程原稿。": "Produced wearable concepts, form and scenario studies, and an interactive installation concept with operation flows.",
  "跨领域概念与设计作品。推测性健康设定不代表真实医疗、健康监测或防护能力。": "These are cross-disciplinary concepts and designs. The speculative health premise does not represent real medical, monitoring, or protective capabilities.",
  "实体交互提醒我：产品不是界面的总和。人的身体、环境和情感，会持续影响每一次操作。": "Physical interaction reminds me that a product is more than its interfaces. The body, environment, and emotions shape every action.",
