  "确认完了心里还是不踏实——因为没有任何反馈告诉我\"你做对了\"。": "Even after checking, I felt unsure: nothing confirmed that I had done it correctly.",
  "纠错：原点 ≠ 中心": "Correction: the origin is not the center",
  "一直以为原点在几何中心，实际从右下角开始——小白最普遍的误区。": "I assumed the origin was the geometric center. It was actually at the lower right: an easy mistake for a beginner.",
  "寻边手抖：本能往反方向拧": "Edge finding: fighting the instinct to turn the wrong way",
  "我必须大脑严格给手发送指令，刻意忍住不往反方向拧。": "I had to consciously guide my hand and resist turning in the opposite direction.",
  "独立走完全流程 🟢": "Completed the full workflow independently 🟢",
  "从完全没操作过 → 独立完成全流程，物理动作和心理路径都是自己走的。": "From no hands-on experience to completing the entire workflow myself, including every action and decision.",
  "断刀×2 + 分中棒\"无法接受\"": "Two broken tools and a daunting center finder",
  "分中棒的难度太大了，我有一点无法接受。": "The center finder felt overwhelmingly difficult to use.",
  "分中：和师傅一模一样 🟢": "Center finding: matched the instructor exactly 🟢",
  "我自己算的 X、Y 原点和师傅完全一致——当时特别特别开心。": "My calculated X and Y origins matched the instructor’s exactly. I was thrilled.",
  "Z 轴对刀：压力依然很大": "Z-axis tool setting: still under pressure",
  "整个过程中我的手一直是紧绷的，注意力全在\"千万别忘了取走垫片\"上。": "My hand stayed tense throughout. All I could think was: remember to remove the shim.",
